---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Rainbow Rope - Tie-Dyed Hemp and Jute"
  description="Our beautiful tie-dyed rainbow rope is available in hemp and jute. Each rope is hand-dyed for a spectacular multi-color effect."
>
  <div id="product_displayII" class="col_w960">
    <h1>Choose Your Rainbow Rope</h1>

    <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:30px;">
      <div style="flex:1; min-width:280px; max-width:300px;">
        <div class="display_product_box">
          <h3>Rainbow Hemp</h3>
          <div class="product_image_box hemp">
            <div class="rope_image_box visible">
              <a href="/hemp/rainbow_rope">
                <img src="/rainbow_rope/hemp/img/main.png" alt="Buy rainbow hemp for rope bondage" style="width:270px; height:300px; border:1px solid #ccc; padding:4px;" />
              </a>
              <div class="color_name" style="margin-top:5px;">
                <p><b>Rainbow Hemp</b></p>
                <div class="rope_price"><p><b>$1.30 ft.</b></p></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="fiber_desc" style="margin:10px 0;">
              <b>Hemp:</b> Hemp bondage rope is soft, strong, and supple. Its earthy smell further enhances the sensuality of this rope.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="flex:1; min-width:280px; max-width:300px;">
        <div class="display_product_box">
          <h3>Rainbow Jute</h3>
          <div class="product_image_box jute">
            <div class="rope_image_box visible">
              <a href="/jute/rainbow_rope">
                <img src="/rainbow_rope/jute/img/main.png" alt="Buy rainbow jute for rope bondage" style="width:270px; height:300px; border:1px solid #ccc; padding:4px;" />
              </a>
              <div class="color_name" style="margin-top:5px;">
                <p><b>Rainbow Jute</b></p>
                <div class="rope_price"><p><b>$1.50 ft.</b></p></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="fiber_desc" style="margin:10px 0;">
              <b>Jute:</b> Jute bondage rope is the preferred bondage rope of the Japanese Nawashi. Its lightness and glossy look make it a favorite among bondage photographers and Shibari performance artists.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
